{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y把不少具体的身体感、空间感和音乐推进压成了短标签，细腻度和随音乐逐步显出的层次明显不如X。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"作为边听边扫的观众，Y的左侧连续讲人为什么这样、接着怎样，右侧只补抓得住的感受，几秒内更容易把因果和前后变化串成一条线；X虽然加亮和到时出现很有帮助，但感受层太密，常会把正在读的叙事链切断。X真正明显胜出的地方是细腻度：很多触觉、身体失重、光线、水面、呼吸和欲言又止的变化，在Y里被压缩后只剩概括词。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7420ef35-9ee5-46a6-a0df-60fa145324e0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T025353721227Z", "elapsed_seconds": 10.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:54:04.363944+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9fb91afb5a3a2f4d3ed1241b4c292775684f253b719bde88bc245deacd8451e4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence